  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "POST /runs with a JWT returns 202; the run continues as a Temporal workflow",
        "Each LLM call and tool call (web_search, deep_analysis) is its own activity in the Temporal UI (:8233)",
        "Every finished run, completed or failed, publishes RUN_FINISHED keyed by run_id"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Reliability",
      "items": [
        "Agent steps retry on their own; a crash resumes from the last finished step",
        "Consumers are at-least-once and idempotent; 3 failures park a message in RUN_FINISHED.DLQ",
        "Redis limits: auth 5/min per IP, runs 5/min and reads 60/min per user; fails open",
        "At most 3 active runs per user; finished runs free their slot via Temporal describe()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not drawn",
      "items": [
        "Temporal keeps its history in Postgres (temporal dbs); the agent calls an OpenAI-compatible LLM and DuckDuckGo",
        "The APIs read users and runs from the same Postgres; notifications dedupe in notifications_sent",
        "Everything runs locally via Docker Compose + Tilt, with UIs for Temporal, Kafka and Postgres"
      ]
    }
  ]
